    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting explanations to a student’s level, providing instant feedback, or generating interactive problems. They can also bridge gaps for students like me, who need extra support without feeling overwhelmed. However, they shouldn’t replace human teachers—just complement them."
